---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
---

{% set featuredArtist = collections.featuredArtists[0] %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrapper hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>Come draw with us.</h1>
      <p class="lede">A queer figure drawing group in Seattle with no pressure and no judgment. Bring a friend or make a new one here. ☺︎</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button" href="{{ site.nextEventUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">RSVP</a>
        <a class="button ghost" href="{{ site.signupUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Get updates</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-media">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero.jpeg" alt="Artists drawing together at Figure It Out." loading="eager"/>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% if featuredArtist %}
  {% set artist = featuredArtist %}
  {% set artistHeaderContent = featuredArtist.templateContent | artistHeaderContent %}
  {% set showReadMore = true %}
  {% set portraitLoading = "lazy" %}
  <section class="next-event featured-artist-preview" id="featured-artist">
    <div class="wrapper">
      <h2>Featured artist</h2>
      {% include "partials/artist-header-card.njk" %}
    </div>
  </section>
{% endif %}
<section class="next-event" id="community-book">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h2>Call for Art: Community Book</h2>
    <div class="event-card">
      <h3 class="event-title">Bring one piece to the April 14 session</h3>
      <div class="event-details">
        <p>One of our beloved regulars, <a href="https://www.fadnessradness.com" target="_blank">Leah Fadness</a>, is presenting a solo show at Vermillion May 7 - 30, 2026. Figure It Out has been an important creative home for her, and she’s using this moment to create a book featuring artwork made at past FIO sessions.</p>
        <p>If you’ve drawn with us, we’d love for you to be part of it.</p>
        <p>Bring one piece you created at Figure It Out to the April 14 session if you’d like it included.</p>
        <p><strong>Requirements</strong></p>
        <ol>
          <li>Must be something you created at Figure It Out</li>
          <li>One piece per person</li>
          <li>
            Include:
            <ul>
              <li>Name</li>
              <li>Social handle / contact info</li>
              <li>~100 - 200 word statement about yourself and/or the work</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <a class="button" href="https://airtable.com/appAvD0d7Mbas2cLJ/pagUg7JpMXUVj1tQD/form" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Submit Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="next-event" id="next-event">
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h2>Next event</h2>
    <div class="event-card">
      <h3 class="event-title">Figure It Out: Sarah</h3>
      <div class="event-card-body">
        <div class="event-details">
          <p>
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            Tuesday, April 14, 2026</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Time:</strong>
            Mingle at 6pm. Drawing at 7pm.</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Location:</strong>
            Vermillion Art Studio, 1501 11th Ave, Seattle, WA 98122</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Cost:</strong>
            $15</p>
          <div class="event-notes">
            <p>People of all skill levels are welcome! Seriously, even if the last thing you drew was a stick figure. This is a
              supportive, creative environment. Ages 21+.</p>
            <p>All proceeds donated to
              <a href="https://www.gaycity.org"  target="_blank">Seattle's LGBTQ+ Center</a>.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Draw our amazing live model.</li>
              <li>Enjoy over 2hrs of drawing with a variety of poses: 2min, 5min, 10min, 15min.</li>
              <li>Connect with a diverse, queer, &amp; inclusive community of artists.</li>
              <li>Enjoy a fine selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks.</li>
              <li>Bring your drawing materials; a pencil and paper is plenty!</li>
              <li>Share your creations and be featured on our Instagram.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>No photos of our model, but photos of the art are encouraged.</p>
          </div>
          <a class="button" href="{{ site.nextEventUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">RSVP / Sign up</a>
        </div>
        <div class="event-media">
          <img src="/assets/images/2026-04-14_sarah.png" alt="Poster for Figure It Out." loading="lazy"/>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
